{
  "slug": "paper-review-system",
  "name": "Paper Review System",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automated academic paper review system for Claude Code. Integrates PDF parsing (marker-pdf + PyMuPDF), reference\nverification (CrossRef + DBLP + Semantic Scholar), SOTA comparison, and competitive paper analysis within a\nstructured multi-phase review pipeline.\n\nFeatures venue-adaptive review strategies for 15+ top CS conferences (CVPR, NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, ECCV, ICCV, ACL,\nAAAI, KDD, MICCAI, etc.), powered by distilled methodologies from 10 senior conference reviewers. Includes\n8-dimension scoring, statistical rigor checks, automated quick assessment, rebuttal assistance, and parallel\nagent-based review architecture.\n\nComponents: 3 commands (/review-paper, /pre-screen, /rebuttal), 4 specialized agents, 1 skill with 5 reference files,\n2 MCP servers (11 tools total), automated dependency checking, and a quick assessment script.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 agents**, **3 commands**, **1 hook** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `paper-review` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"审稿\", \"review paper\", \"审阅论文\", \"评审论文\", \"paper review\", \"检查论文质量\",…)\n- **Agents** (4): `paper-analyzer` (Use this agent to parse and analyze academic PDF papers), `paper-comparator` (Use this agent to find and compare recent competing papers (within 12 months) against the paper being reviewed), `reference-auditor` (Use this agent to audit and verify academic paper references), `technical-reviewer` (Use this agent for technical review of academic papers including formula verification, experiment analysis, and SOTA comparison)\n- **Commands** (3): `pre-screen` (论文快速质量预筛选，不做完整审稿，仅输出量化质量信号。适合批量筛选。), `rebuttal` (辅助撰写 rebuttal / 检查修改稿是否回应了审稿意见。), `review-paper` (自动化学术论文审稿。提供 PDF 路径即可启动完整审稿流程，支持按目标会议适配评审标准。)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `paper-parser`, `academic-search`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install paper-review-system@claude-community` from `lidapengpeng/paper-review-system`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
